      (BepInEx, base game assemblies, Unity, GC2). We point at the sibling
      SMSAndroids checkout's Libraries folder rather than copying binaries
      into this repo — see SMSAndroids/SMSAndroidsCore.csproj for the canonical
      list. If a contributor doesn't have SMSAndroids checked out, this
      project won't compile (the editor still does).
    -->
    <SmsLibs>..\..\SMSAndroids\Libraries\</SmsLibs>
  </PropertyGroup>
